     surface that offers it (the phone's capture row, the watch's destination
     screen; the web draws the same name) — outline, 1.75px stroke, rounded
     caps, `ic_inbox.xml`'s recipe. Drawn in white and tinted at use: icons
     never carry colour independently of their label. `flag` stays the
     deadline glyph in item metadata; this one names the gesture that writes
     today's. -->
